      "x": 241,
      "y": 191,
      "init": {
        "label": "Daily notes as a time series",
        "body": "# Your daily notes as a time series\nWith the daily-notes date format set, **Vault Folder** reads each file name into a `date` column, so a folder of daily notes sorts like a series. Here a 7-day **rolling average** smooths the nightly sleep, and the line shows the trend under the noise.\n\nThe **Daily** table is a snapshot so this runs on the web. On desktop, point the **Vault Folder** below at your vault: Sort and Filter run straight on it, and this same chain takes over once the columns match.",
        "color": "violet",
        "width": 380,
        "height": 250
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "daily",
      "type": "FrameInputNode",
      "x": 294,
      "y": 569,
      "init": {
        "label": "Daily (snapshot)",
        "frameText": "[{\"name\":\"Day\",\"type\":\"string\",\"values\":[\"2026-08-25\",\"2026-08-26\",\"2026-08-27\",\"2026-08-28\",\"2026-08-29\",\"2026-08-30\",\"2026-08-31\",\"2026-09-01\",\"2026-09-02\",\"2026-09-03\",\"2026-09-04\",\"2026-09-05\",\"2026-09-06\",\"2026-09-07\"]},{\"name\":\"Sleep h\",\"type\":\"number\",\"values\":[7.2,7.9,6.3,8.1,8.3,7.0,6.5,7.5,6.0,8.0,7.8,7.0,7.6,8.2]},{\"name\":\"Weight\",\"type\":\"number\",\"values\":[179.4,179.1,179.3,178.9,178.7,178.8,178.9,178.2,178.6,177.9,177.5,177.8,177.6,177.4]}]"
